Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: __ARCH__
Maintainer: OpenSurge maintainers <opensurge@example.invalid>
Depends: dnsmasq, nftables, iproute2, ca-certificates, systemd
Description: OpenSurge Linux gateway and LAN control plane
 OpenSurge provides a Linux gateway data plane and a LAN HTTPS control plane.
 The package installs binaries and service boundaries but never starts the
 gateway during installation.
